WEBVTT - TYPO3 v14 development: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.053
Agents still write TYPO3 code from old memory.
These skills teach them version fourteen.

2
00:00:10.153 --> 00:00:17.637
TYPO3 v14 development: four skills for TYPO3
v14.

3
00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:29.399
Shows how v14 code is written: controllers,
ViewFactory, PSR-14 events, TCA, QueryBuilder
and CLI.

4
00:00:30.749 --> 00:00:33.740
Agents often mix up versions.

5
00:00:35.799 --> 00:00:42.786
A version-aware reference for TypoScript,
TSconfig and Fluid, with a local lookup.

6
00:00:44.136 --> 00:00:47.780
TypoScript keys are easy to misremember.

7
00:00:49.186 --> 00:00:56.826
Builds v14 backend Web Components with Lit,
import maps and FormEngine integration.

8
00:00:58.176 --> 00:01:03.674
It turns jQuery-era backend code into standard
Web Components.

9
00:01:05.074 --> 00:01:13.446
Starts and reaches a local TYPO3 instance with
DDEV, for one version or several side by side.

10
00:01:14.796 --> 00:01:19.040
Most other skills need a running instance to
check their work.

11
00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.780
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
